Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:04.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说 猎人 记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore, hunters, man of letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of them are crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今试图找回你哥哥已经毫无意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point in trying to bring your brother back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说话的根本不是真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't even the real you I'm talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是真正的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's the real me, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 我挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing? - I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出了岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If things go sideways…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是一点差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like, an inch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta give me the heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去干活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 鬼魂 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Spirits? Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么 - 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - This can't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要抓的是灯灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunting a djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯灵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A freaking geni!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸脂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a pishtaco.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜直怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fish taco?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是类人机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a mandroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampire pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蓝精灵 - 是小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smurfs? - Fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.69,0:00:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有乳头耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nipples?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:00:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻象怪需要很多的精神能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tulpas require a-a ton of psychic energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡利奥佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Calliope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道我们要对付的是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what we are dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是超巨魔童（电影鬼马小精灵中的白色胖鬼）\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Stay Puft Marshmallow Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:08.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（康涅狄格州 新迦南）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道今天很沉痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a terribly sad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦妮·拉克鲁瓦是个好女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunny LaCroix was a good woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个心慈仁义的主顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fair employer with a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is work to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到24小时内\N{\fnArial\fs30}In less than 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克鲁瓦家族就会来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the LaCroix famiy will descend upon this estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加葬礼 听遗嘱宣读\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the funeral and the reading of the will,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要确保别墅一切井然有条\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is our duty to make sure this manor's in tip-top shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们欠邦妮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe that much to Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,科洛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扫主衣物间\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the master closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去选出拉克鲁瓦太太下葬的衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to select Mrs. LaCroix's wardrobe for the burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必确保所有厕所都一尘不染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please make sure all the lavatories are spotless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是新雇员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still the new hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,科洛蒂要比你有资质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colette has seniority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧 没时间浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop-chop. There's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独煮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Individually brewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,科技改变生活啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technology, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真汉子不喝这么小杯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real men don't drink out of cups this small.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么味儿的 肉桂卷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that… "Cinnamon roll"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是糖霜甜甜圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, "Glazed donut."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, if you don't want it, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, it's… got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,警用频道或内网上有情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, any leads on the scanner or the…interweb?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 连猫上树都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing… not even a cat up a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说我们打算重出江湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}So right when we're ready to jump back into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,江湖却一片风平浪静\N{\fnArial\fs30}it, uh, goes radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲定律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy's law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Murphy's a douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,想绕路去康涅狄格州一趟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, feel like taking a detour to Connecticut?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做清理的时候发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it while I was dustbusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of Bobby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:04:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,总共有27条留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, in total, 27 messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一有意思的是两天前的一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one that counts is from two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比是一位邦妮·拉克鲁瓦的遗嘱受益人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, Bobby's been named a beneficiary in Bunny LaCroix's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦妮谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunny LaWho?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,律师说她是位女继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attorney said she's an heiress,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比本人或其近亲要去一趟新迦南\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Bobby's presence or next of kin is being requested in New Canaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们算得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured we qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比怎么会认识女继承人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Bobby know an heiress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比也有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby had secrets, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如喜欢托瑞·斯培林（女演员）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like loving on Tori Spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他知道迪恩劈腿该多难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he only knew Dean cheated on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, road trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定鲍比给我们留下了买酒钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows? Maybe Bobby earned us some beer money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们穿得是不是不够隆重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we're a little underdressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局那身就在后箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the fed threads are in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于有一次不用穿西装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, we don't have to wear suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我的腰带不是弹性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky my waistband's not elastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆·温彻斯特 这是迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam Winchester. This is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们代表鲍比·辛格前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here on behalf of Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛格先生不能来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Singer won't be coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 他去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, condolences for your loss, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚刚错过葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just missed the funeral,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但家里人都在里面休息 你们请进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the family's relaxing inside, if you'd like to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我介绍萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是韦斯切斯特的温彻斯特家族的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester of the Westchester Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}U-uh, n… no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think there's…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 什么关系 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nah. - …any relation. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海蒂 邦妮的亲戚 这是我妹妹贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Heddy, Bunny's cousin, and this is my sister, Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charmed, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是邦妮的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's Bunny's youngest brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿 喊他斯坦就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanton… "Stan" for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起哀悼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join the mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的小新娘 安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his child bride, Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Stan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你都打扰我注意力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, don't. You're breaking my concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有戴什 家里最小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's Dash. That's the baby of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是邦妮的曾侄 哈佛商学院的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Bunny's great-nephew… Harvard business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么认识邦妮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you guys know aunt Bunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其实并不认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we… we didn't personally know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的干爹 鲍比·辛格认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our… our surrogate dad, Bobby Singer, did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们周末可以跟我们讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can fill us in over the weekend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,律师没说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't the attorney tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天举行葬礼 明天宣读遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service was today, and the reading of the will tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以在这里过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but you're welcome to spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有房间都是双人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the rooms sleep two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:07:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,科洛蒂哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Colette?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她辞职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的姑娘对拉克鲁瓦太太的死伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor dear was so distraught over Mrs. LaCroix's passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是去寻找自我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went off to find herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去印度修行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashram in India?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉索塔一家小丑学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, clown college in Sarasota.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后能去大堂跟二位说两句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have a word with you in the hall in five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你锻炼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you…work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charmed, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些什么人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是叫做权贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're called W.A.S.P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉刚刚没明说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies for being so oblique back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是为了你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm doing you boys a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克鲁瓦太太给辛格先生留了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. LaCroix bequeathed something to your Mr. Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明天遗嘱才会宣读\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the reading of the will isn't until tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你们要被迫留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I would hate for you to have to stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟主人家…交际\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be forced to… well, mingle with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 管家先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道哪个叉子是吃虾用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know which one the shrimp fork is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr. Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的意思是 我觉得你们不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're implying that I don't think you're good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}i-it's quite the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're far too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克鲁瓦家族是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The LaCroix family is…well…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么礼貌点说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How shall I say this politely?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群贪财的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…money-grubbing leeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 我以为他们都是权贵呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? I thought they were all loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 但并不有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loaded… yes. Rich… no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都遭受了经济衰退的打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The recession hit every one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们知道了邦妮给你们留下了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm afraid if they knew what Bunny left you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些秃鹰会企图抢财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}those vultures would try to stake claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为律师好心同意提前把东西拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since the attorney kindly agreed to a hand-off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就不必遭受他们的刺探了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to be subjected to their scrutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道邦妮和鲍比怎么认识的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how Bunny and Bobby knew each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没别的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, now, if there's nothing else,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让奥利维亚送你们出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall I have Olivia show you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我们自己认路 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. That's, uh… we got it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么花哨的东西居然留给鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of fancy to leave a guy like Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我想到一起去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦妮跟鲍比有一腿 这些石头是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Bunny was banging Bobby, then maybe these rocks are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean it's not real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老太太可有钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old bag was rolling in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那老太太是喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like the old bag's got a soft spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,假红宝石和方晶锆石\N{\fnArial\fs30}for fake rubies and cubic zirconium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is interesting, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A key to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道只有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one way to find out…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去问管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask Jeeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝弗利看见你晚餐时发色情短信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly saw you sexting at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝弗就是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev doesn't know what the hell she's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在给我妈发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was texting my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,发一个剥开香蕉的表情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}An emoticon of a peeled banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢水果\N{\fnArial\fs30}She likes fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 你出轨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just admit it… you're cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还多疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟兰斯一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总说可怜的邦妮跟别人上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always accusing poor Bunny of sleeping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她的确有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐就是个穿香奈儿的下贱婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister was nothing but a two-bit hooker in Chanel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩都死得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good riddance to you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们二位是落下什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume you gentlemen left something behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去衣橱找找…粗麻布\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check the front closet for…burlap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.05,0:12:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 管家先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got news for you, {\u1}Mr. Belvedere{\u0}…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这身是帆布的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jacket's canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,二位之前来过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… you two were here earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who wants to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德警探 新迦南警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Howard, New Canaan P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在正式是凶案嫌疑人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're now officially murder suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦妮·拉克鲁瓦的弟弟斯坦顿今晚被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Bunny LaCroix's brother Stanton was killed this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的尸体刚运去停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body's just gone to the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得… - 我不知道该怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you think… - I don't know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他今天来过这栋别墅的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and anyone else who stepped foot in this house today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要被扣留接受审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}is being detained for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝弗利 放开我 显然是她干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly, let go of me! It's so obvious she's guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 老太婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off your rocker, old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「老太婆」 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Old lady"?! I…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才39岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,自03年就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have been since '03.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How… how dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰了 你说是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to interrupt, but… but who's guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个骚货 安珀 是她杀了斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The town slut, Amber. She killed Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她什么动机呢 大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's her motive, "{\u1}Murder, she wrote{\u0}"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道安珀在到处乱搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, everyone knows that Amber was sleeping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想离开斯坦 但她的婚前协议十分牢固\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to leave Stan, but her prenup was ironclad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是她就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去挺合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, unless you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的那套可笑的说辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ridiculous story that she's been peddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一个鬼魂杀了斯坦顿」 真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A ghost killed Stanton"… honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, a-a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说是邦妮过世的丈夫 兰斯做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's claming that Bunny's late husband, Lance, did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听过这种事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever heard such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可笑 蠢成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a panic! So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因为那些合成激素 脑子都不正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nutty as a squirrel on those synthetic hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不正常」 你真过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nutty"? How appalling of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈佛不教礼貌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't they teach you manners in Harvard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们遇上桩案子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…looks like we might have a case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 复仇鬼魂 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vengeful spirit? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能去车里拿电磁干扰仪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we can get to the car, get the EMF?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个警探盯着呢 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with, uh, detective friendly. Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能采取老办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we're gonna have to go old-school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 找冷点 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Cold spots it is. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.16,0:14:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下盯着虚荣女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, keep an eye on Mrs. Peacock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和高帅富 我去四处看看 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and colonel mustard. I'll sniff around. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 我已经有一艘漂亮的大游艇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your information, I already own a big, beautiful yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管那东西叫游艇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that what you call that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是红木单帆船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. It's a mahogany sunfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 作为刚刚失去两个家庭成员的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to say, for a family that just lost two members,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们似乎都没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you all…seem fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我告诉你个家族秘密吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sam, I'll let you in on a little family secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不怎么喜欢彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't really like each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 哪个家庭喜欢彼此呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again, what family does?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有我和哥哥相依为命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just my brother and me, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这样算奇迹了 我们在一个屋檐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me… it's a miracle we've been under the same roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,待了24小时还没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 24 hours and haven't…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么确定不是安珀干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, w-why are you so sure Amber didn't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀不是杀人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Amber's not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.06,0:15:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她连用无线网络都不怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has trouble using wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她是杀不成人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't exactly think she's capable of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的那个鬼魂的故事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her story about the ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果有人会阴魂不散\N{\fnArial\fs30}That said, if anyone would come back to haunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定是兰斯叔叔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's uncle Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他人很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard he was a real bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了没人心疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one really mourned his death…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了邦妮姑妈 他死后她闭门不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except aunt Bunny, who became a recluse after he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许那老家伙有什么不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe the old goat has a chip on his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 我以为你是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god. I thought you were him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普 那个管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phillip… the butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我锁了起来 因为我不肯撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He locked me in here because I wouldn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对警探隐瞒我看到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the detective about what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他用毯子把科洛蒂的尸体裹了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him roll Colette's body in a rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去小丑学院的科洛蒂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown college Colette?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,管家杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The butler killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.07,0:19:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 他只是藏尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He just… he just hid her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道听上去很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is gonna sound crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是邦妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.95,0:19:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊 留下嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见管家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen the butler?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果有人知道是怎么回事 那就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if anybody has answers, it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有两个复仇鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with two vengeful spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来邦妮姑妈也有怨愤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, aunt Bunny had a bee in her bonnet, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫妻鬼魂杀人组吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husband-and-wife tag-team killer ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻总得想办法维系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, got to keep the marriage alive somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把钥匙 通往一间隐藏的阁楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key… is to a hidden attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦妮为什么要把阁楼的钥匙给鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Bunny want Bobby to have a key to her attic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 还有更怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It gets weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现奥利维亚和科洛蒂都锁在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found Olivia and Colette locked inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丑学院的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown college Colette?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但她没去学扎气球动物 她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but she ain't studying balloon animals. She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,管家跟这些事有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what does the butler have to do with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把她们锁在里面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who locked them in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他在掩盖鬼魂的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's covering for the spooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.37,0:20:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,做他们的忠仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's acting like their {\u1}Renfield{\u0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看楼上 你看楼下 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take upstairs. You take down here. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么在这里鬼鬼祟祟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha doing snooping around these halls, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没安好心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起做点坏事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we get up to no good together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道人说年纪越长的女人越会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they say women just get better with age,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像好酒 或干酪一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a fine wine or… or cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不耐乳糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}U-uh, I-I… uh, I'm lactose-intolerant, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么扭捏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be coy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我接受盘问还有10分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got a good 10 minutes before my interrogation,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样年轻的小伙子10分钟肯定能干不少事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I bet a young buck like you can do a lot in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.45,0:21:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我先请」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Right behind me."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拉下拉链好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you just give me a hand with this zipper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是拉不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always have such a hard time…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:48.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（管家房间）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有个水龙头漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, leaky faucet's down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,少跟我闲扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the crap, Wadsworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么把死去的女仆藏在密室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing hiding dead maids in secret rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道看上去很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it all looks rather…peculiar,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.19,0:23:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把科洛蒂的尸体藏在了阁楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you hid Colette's body in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.41,0:23:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让她不抢走邦妮的风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that she wouldn't steal Bunny's thunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让拉克鲁瓦太太的葬礼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't stand the thought of overshadowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再出桩人命 吸引走大家的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. LaCroix's funeral with another death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该体面接受送别 这是我欠她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserved a proper farewell. I owed it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.73,0:23:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 温彻斯特先生 这是忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr. Winchester. That's loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.05,0:23:34.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆 找到了菲利普的尸体）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.07,0:24:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.13,0:24:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - It's no ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.50,0:24:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.85,0:24:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个易形者以装死人为乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the shifter's getting its jollies by impersonating dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 先是邦妮 然后是兰斯 菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. First Bunny, then Lance, now phillip.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.17,0:24:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来可以排除是「管家干的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we can rule out "The butler did it."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个变态刚刚蜕了皮 现在可能是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the creep just shed, so now it could be anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.86,0:24:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是你 我们得找银具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you. We need to find some silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.32,0:24:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.49,0:24:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现他时他就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like that when we found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.58,0:24:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.46,0:24:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know yet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.32,0:24:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你以为他是跟鬼魂一伙儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think he was working with ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.43,0:25:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实情况要糟得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's something way worse going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.83,0:25:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还糟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse than…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.38,0:25:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想帮忙 就帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to help, then help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要银器干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need the silverware?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}For protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.84,0:25:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,用黄油刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butter knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.81,0:25:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我们 我们这是有道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust us … there's a method to our madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能拿一下这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you, uh, hold this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.66,0:25:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.69,0:25:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.58,0:25:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.59,0:25:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.35,0:25:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.24,0:25:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 上一个 他有座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Go back. He owned an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有兔唇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a harelip.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.89,0:25:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他能让你在富丽堂皇的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who cares if he's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.01,0:25:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝迈代鸡尾酒 谁在乎他丑不丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're drinking mai tais in the lap of luxury?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.46,0:25:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.54,0:25:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给贝弗利挑男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to find Beverly a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在都在网上钓男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've resorted to fishing online.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.98,0:26:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为现实中有些人不肯咬钩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the live ones won't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.31,0:26:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说刚才的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.03,0:26:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在欲擒故纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was just playing hard-to-get.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.22,0:26:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你演得还真像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very convincing actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.59,0:26:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.88,0:26:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好咧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.78,0:26:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit here. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.87,0:26:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 我觉得我被冷落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo. I'm feeling so left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.53,0:26:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, uh… come on in, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.95,0:26:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.62,0:27:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.33,0:27:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We…can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.57,0:27:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 去年圣诞你们空虚难耐 就好上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. You two got bored last Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.19,0:27:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是在新迦南的海滨宴会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Canaan Clambake, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在吃自助餐 软壳蛤没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in line at the buffet, they ran out of steamers,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.52,0:27:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一来二去就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}one thing led to another, and, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们没有杀斯坦顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we didn't kill Stanton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.60,0:27:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们虽然有婚外情 但我们没有杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be guilty of cheating, but not murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摸一下这个 - 什么 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Touch these. - What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.56,0:27:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快照做 不然我就把海滨宴会的事全说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, or I go cards-up on your whole Clambake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.58,0:27:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 通过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did…we pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.84,0:27:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我不会说出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Your secret is safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.02,0:27:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.21,0:27:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他手指多长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see how long his fingers were?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.67,0:27:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见没 多长\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, did you see this? Look how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.43,0:27:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要等你们完事儿了我再过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I come back when you're done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.71,0:27:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在叫我 我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's … he's … he's calling to me, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.13,0:28:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一场好戏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's all going to hell right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你雅兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Grey Gardens" Cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是戴什和安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, so is Dash and Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.51,0:28:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们在偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a thing, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 权贵们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y… Yeah. W.A.S.P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.80,0:28:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so, that's everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.48,0:28:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.03,0:28:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好 又多了个淹死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got a floater.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.42,0:28:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.42,0:28:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.78,0:28:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹死在马桶里 脏死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drowned in a toilet? How filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.20,0:28:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的禽兽才干得出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of monster would do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.02,0:28:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看我啊 我只是来小解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me. I was just trying to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 先别急着互相指责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on. Before we start pointing fingers …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.03,0:28:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀有动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber has motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.35,0:28:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀了警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed the detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.46,0:28:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她知道他迟早会查出\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she knew that it was just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.10,0:28:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她杀了斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he figured out she killed Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 神探 这就破案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, {\u1}Rizzoli{\u0}. You solved the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.55,0:29:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想猜猜看吗 妙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to weigh in, too, {\u1}Isles{\u0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.21,0:29:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿和警探都不是我杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill Stanton or the detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.57,0:29:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.04,0:29:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的不在场证明就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My alibi is in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.86,0:29:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.90,0:29:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀没有杀警探 因为她那时候跟我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber couldn't have killed the detective, 'cause she was with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.72,0:29:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.56,0:29:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有私情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're… sleeping together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.88,0:29:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道 - 那你也有动机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - Well, then, you have motive, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.02,0:29:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了斯坦因为你在跟他老婆偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You offed Stan because you were diddling his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.76,0:29:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老太婆话太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. The old lady doth protest too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.13,0:29:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指责我们只是为了撇清你自己的嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're only pointing the finger to distract from your own guilt,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.13,0:29:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好这恶女就是你的帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you probably got baby Jane to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好大胆 我先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I never! I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.65,0:29:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.34,0:29:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 话要好好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, who talks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.66,0:29:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 所有人都不许走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second of all, no one's leaving, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.47,0:29:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, get your hands off me, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.63,0:29:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 我不相信任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, see, I don't trust anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.56,0:29:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走只会加重你的嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And leaving just makes you look guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.36,0:29:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩说得对 现在已经死了四个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean is right, okay? We have four corpses now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.73,0:29:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four corpses?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.26,0:29:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你可以把菲利普和科洛蒂也算上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You can add Phillip and Colette to the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.75,0:29:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去小丑学院的科洛蒂吗 我以为她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown College Colette? But I thought …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.40,0:29:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了 好吗 她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, all right? She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:29:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要是还一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相指责的话 我们是帮不了你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you stop arguing with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.77,0:30:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不认识你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we don't even know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.10,0:30:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我跟你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, buddy, I'm trying to be objective here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家的问题一向是数都数不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we've had countless family functions before,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.50,0:30:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天到晚恨不得杀了对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even though we wanted to kill one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.51,0:30:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们从没那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}we never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.27,0:30:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们的家庭聚会从不会以谋杀结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dash is right. Our get-togethers never end in murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,与以往唯一不同的是你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing different this time around is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Okay, first of all, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.06,0:30:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在暗示些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're suggesting …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.09,0:30:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.08,0:30:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.96,0:30:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.38,0:30:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猎过野鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…hunt pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.73,0:30:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警察来之前给我坐好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight until the cops get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.20,0:30:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要想活着出去只能靠我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are your best shot at making it out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.65,0:30:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是坏人 戴什\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not the bad guys, Dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.21,0:30:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我不敢苟同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.46,0:30:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还穿着法兰绒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wearing flannel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.57,0:31:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.30,0:31:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 是从外面锁上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's locked from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.43,0:31:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逗我呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.29,0:31:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.05,0:31:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「台湾制造」 该死的不锈钢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Made in Taiwan." Freakin' stainless steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.85,0:31:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是没有人被烧伤的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why no one sizzled?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都不是真的银\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not even real silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.15,0:31:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是方晶锆石 然后是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, cubic zirconium, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.49,0:31:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得富人都还那么富\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder the rich stay rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.61,0:31:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么杀了这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we gonna kill this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.84,0:31:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们车后箱里有银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we got silver bullets in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.87,0:31:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是我们能从这里出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, assuming we ever make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.50,0:31:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 萨姆和迪恩为什么要杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. Why would Sam and Dean want us dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.29,0:31:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不明显吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想夺取我们的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted our inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.78,0:31:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜邦妮姑妈留给他们的东西不够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess whatever aunt Bunny left them wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.61,0:31:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的分上 戴什\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of god, Dash,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.45,0:32:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你杀了谁之前放下那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down the gun before you kill someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.12,0:32:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.87,0:32:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是…猎过…野鸡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…hunt…pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.64,0:32:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他俩开着那辆美国车来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew those boys were trailer trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.18,0:32:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他们不是什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the moment they rolled up in that American-made.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.76,0:32:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention homosexuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.61,0:32:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,同性恋杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Homosexual murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.17,0:32:21.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像利奥伯德和勒伯（电影《迷魂索》的两位男主角）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Leopold and Loeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.99,0:32:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过这两位更性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.59,0:32:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Call the police at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.96,0:32:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看还是免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.64,0:32:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.57,0:32:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有没有凶手 你都还在上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killer or no killer, you're still on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.34,0:32:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群蠢货真是错的离谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiots couldn't be more wrong …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.05,0:32:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.29,0:32:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们难道不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如凶手不是管家 那就是女佣了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it's not the butler, it's the maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.85,0:32:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.77,0:33:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.96,0:33:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被那个女佣耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got played by the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.30,0:33:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,两扇门都是加固过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both doors are reinforced.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.35,0:33:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.94,0:33:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得你打扫得不干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.16,0:33:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邦妮的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bunny's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.52,0:33:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 邦妮没有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Bunny didn't have a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她有 还是个非常孝顺的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, she did … a very devoted one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.44,0:33:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱母亲胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved mother more than anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.40,0:33:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你们任何一个人都爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is more than I can say for any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.70,0:33:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你这些年都躲在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, where have you been hiding all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.01,0:33:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阁楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.84,0:33:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和电影里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like in the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.85,0:33:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.98,0:33:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了妈妈之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside of mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.70,0:34:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普是这栋宅子里唯一的知情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phillip was the only one at the manor who knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她去世之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after she died,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.34,0:34:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可怜我 就把我放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took pity on me, and he let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.14,0:34:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我装作是新来的女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me to pose as the new maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.27,0:34:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就能藏在你们眼前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can hide in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.94,0:34:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你杀了科洛蒂的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you killed Colette …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.55,0:34:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了得到她的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}for her job?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.77,0:34:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 科洛蒂的死只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no. Colette was just an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.45,0:34:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想吓吓她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to scare her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我发现她偷东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I caught her stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.69,0:34:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也没法解释你为什么想杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that doesn't explain wanting us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.90,0:34:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不是贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us are thieves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们更坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}On, no. You're worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.57,0:34:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的贪婪 鄙弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your greed, your disdain,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.68,0:34:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,公然不尊重母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}your blatant disrespect for mother …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.09,0:34:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you all had it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.97,0:34:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么杀了菲利普呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…why kill Phillip?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.57,0:34:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他站在你那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if he was on your side…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.11,0:34:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.70,0:34:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦顿死后 他把我锁了回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Stanton, he locked me back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.64,0:34:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是 那个可爱的小傻瓜放我出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for me, the cute, dumb one let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.03,0:34:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.83,0:34:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try these.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.14,0:34:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你会被锁起来 你是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you were locked away. You're a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.50,0:34:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你就不了解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.83,0:35:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in god's name …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.15,0:35:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.23,0:35:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.99,0:35:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人尿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone else wet themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.15,0:35:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞄不准我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a clear shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.48,0:35:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.39,0:35:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你的快感 会仅次于杀死鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing you is the next best thing to killing Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.88,0:36:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和鲍比有什么恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your beef with Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.26,0:36:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 他杀了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, he killed my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯是易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance was a shifter?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.17,0:36:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯不是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance wasn't my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.28,0:36:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲和易形者偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother had an affair with a shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.79,0:36:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀了孕 她告诉兰斯我是他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got pregnant, told Lance I was his.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bought it…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.09,0:36:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她从医院把我带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until she brought me back from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.95,0:36:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真正的父亲在那里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real dad was waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.94,0:36:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯奋力抵抗 但他不是易形者的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lance put up a fight, but he was no match for a shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.05,0:36:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我父亲要带走我时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just as my dad was about to take me…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.32,0:36:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人变成了猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the hunter became the hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.09,0:36:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.93,0:36:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比杀死我父亲后 又要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Bobby killed my father, he came after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.78,0:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲求他饶过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother pleaded with him to spare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.87,0:36:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他同意了 但提出了一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He agreed … under one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:36:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要一直锁着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she keep you locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.75,0:37:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保我和其他人的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my safety and the safety of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.83,0:37:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲告诉其他人 她的孩子没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother told the family she lost the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.04,0:37:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我锁在阁楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she locked me in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.00,0:37:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她自始至终都为我付出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she remained devoted to me until the very end …
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.10,0:37:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至让鲍比同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even got Bobby to promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.09,0:37:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,若她遭遇不幸 他就照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take care of me if anything happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.02,0:37:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 鲍比饶了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Then, Bobby spared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.61,0:37:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该心存感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.37,0:37:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激他让我一辈子被关着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping me locked up my whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.65,0:37:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我会更仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have been kinder to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.88,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.03,0:37:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.46,0:37:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,做怪物是一种选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a monster is a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.74,0:37:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个选择 有人很久之前就替我选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That choice was made for me a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.49,0:37:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么还不开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you taken a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.38,0:38:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有银子弹了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any silver bullets, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.91,0:38:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.43,0:38:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不会错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, no, you can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.78,0:38:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街道尽头的大房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big house on the end of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.70,0:38:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bye, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.36,0:38:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.91,0:38:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.03,0:38:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个乱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.47,0:38:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你们一个道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you two an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.12,0:38:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.58,0:38:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是为了保护家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you were just protecting your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.44,0:38:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…there's nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.59,0:38:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和邦妮姑妈的律师通了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I spoke to aunt Bunny's attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.40,0:39:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说除了吊坠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, outside from the pendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.54,0:39:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有一切都留给了奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything was left to Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.42,0:39:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.62,0:39:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of that…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.06,0:39:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该留着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you guys should keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.61,0:39:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是阁楼钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a key to the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.45,0:39:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比一定对邦妮姑妈非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby must have really meant something to aunt Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎样报答你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.66,0:39:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.49,0:39:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了我们来过就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just forget we were ever here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.70,0:39:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让大家都知道你们多么英勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone to know what heroes you …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.94,0:39:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我们救下你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, pal, the fact that we pulled your bacon out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.52,0:39:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和别人无关 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is nobody's business. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.92,0:39:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious, {\u1}Izod{\u0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.16,0:39:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a pin in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.11,0:39:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们会回来找你算账的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we'll come back for your preppy ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.55,0:40:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你刚刚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what was that all about back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.67,0:40:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.34,0:40:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,多余的那几枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… all those extra shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.52,0:40:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,易形者已经死了之后的那几枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the shifter was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.54,0:40:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.27,0:40:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 打靶练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Target practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.64,0:40:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it wasn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.71,0:40:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不上来 残留的恶魔或是和血印有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, demon residue or something to do with the mark or …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.11,0:40:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.17,0:40:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.71,0:40:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.05,0:40:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I got to be honest …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.81,0:41:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.62,0:41:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我…恢复后第一次杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my first kill since I've been back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.71,0:41:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got a little anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.13,0:41:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要确保自己没做错什么 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to make sure it was done right … plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.02,0:41:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.54,0:41:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么还要解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I even explaining this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.53,0:41:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I …
